    /**
     * Woodsman: a thick fur roll, hanging ear flaps and an oak-leaf sprig; a fur mantle collar and shoulder pads, a
     * laced front, a hide belt with an iron buckle; leather knee patches; fur boot cuffs and laces.
     */
